# Go Standards

- Keep packages small: cmd, internal/workflow, internal/search, etc.
- Interfaces in provider packages; mocks alongside
- Always run `go test ./...` before finishing
- Use `make build` not raw go build in docs unless debugging
- Errors wrap with context: fmt.Errorf("step: %w", err)
- No comments unless user requests
- Deterministic mode must keep TestDeterministicSameInputsSameOutputs passing
